          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I run GTA 6 on a laptop?",
            "answer": "Possibly. Laptop versions of a graphics card are slower than the desktop card with the same name, so tick the laptop box in the checker and it lowers the score by about a fifth. A laptop with built-in graphics only is unlikely to run it."
          }
        },
